{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Line Goes UP is an idle game where you watch a line go up. Even though it starts simple enough, soon you will unlock new lines, tools and challenges to complete, that will allow you to reach unmatched heights. Will you uncover all the misteries of the grid?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a short and concise take on the incremental genre, where your numbers never stop growing. On top of that, you will have to make decisions and modify your lines in order to obtain the maximum profit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The line inhabits an ever growing two dimensional grid, and it increases beyond what you'll see in any graph, statistic or the global market. The most powerful line is hidden beyond a series of challenges that you shall overcome, altering your line so that it forms extravagant paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732800/extras/46a34c00e77681fcfa57aa33600638b9.avif?t=1750648420\" width=618 height=178 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast incremental progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape-based puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intuitive and customizable integrated interface</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging goals to unlock further growth</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Content:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple lines to unlock and upgrade</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modifications to the grid that can make powerfull synergies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short and concise playtime, around 2 hours</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chill unique soundtrack</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted